OL,3,GNEWSABereaved families call for public
OL,4,Ainquiry into maternity care
OL,5,
OL,6,FBereaved parents have come together in
OL,7,FGlasgow to call for a public inquiry
OL,8,Finto the deaths of babies and mothers
OL,9,Facross Scotland.
OL,11,FA nine-month independent review of
OL,12,FScotland's maternity services started
OL,13,Flast month after families, staff and
OL,14,Fexperts called for improvements to poor
OL,15,Fand sometimes deadly care in a BBC
OL,16,FDisclosure investigation.
OL,18,FBut families who have lost babies
OL,19,Ffollowing failures claimed the current
OL,20,Freview would not go far enough, and
OL,21,Fhave demanded "answers, accountability
OL,22,Fand justice for our babies".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
